// The Rustboro Trainer Exchange: five counters whose stock grows with the
// BUYING player's own badges (and a quest where named). Stock, prices and
// tutor moves are data, generated by tools/coop_exchange/stock.py into
// src/data/coop_exchange_stock.h.
//
// Everything here reads and changes this game's save only: its badges and
// quest flags pick the stock, its money pays, its bag and party receive. A
// linked partner's progress never unlocks anything here, and two players
// can use the same counter at once (each runs the clerk's script on their
// own game; src/coop_talk.c lets shops and these counters run side by
// side).
